	.string "You passed with flying colors!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_WendyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_WendyPostBattle::
	.string "To best even me…\n"
	.string "Your strength is marvelous!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_BraxtonIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_BraxtonIntro::
	.string "You seem to have a big collection\n"
	.string "of GYM BADGES.\p"
	.string "Let me see if you're actually worthy of\n"
	.string "those BADGES!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_BraxtonDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_BraxtonDefeat::
	.string "Oh, you're worthy, all right!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_BraxtonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_BraxtonPostBattle::
	.string "You did your BADGES proud in that\n"
	.string "match!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_VioletIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_VioletIntro::
	.string "They say that good times are filled\n"
	.string "with good aromas.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_VioletDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_VioletDefeat::
	.string "Oh…\n"
	.string "I smell the bitter scent of misery…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_VioletPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_VioletPostBattle::
	.string "The BERRY MASTER's garden is filled\n"
	.string "with uplifting fragrances.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_YukiIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_YukiIntro::
	.string "YUKI: Okay!\n"
	.string "We're beating the TRAINER's POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_YukiDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_YukiDefeat::
	.string "YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_YukiNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route123_Text_YukiNotEnoughMons::
	.string "YUKI: It's no fun to battle if you\n"
	.string "don't have two POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_YukiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_YukiPostBattle::
	.string "YUKI: Why are you so strong?\n"
	.string "We've never lost before.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_MiuIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_MiuIntro::
	.string "MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your\n"
	.string "POKéMON won't cry when they lose.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_MiuDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_MiuDefeat::
	.string "MIU: Uh-oh, we lost.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_MiuNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route123_Text_MiuNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MIU: It's no fun to battle if you\n"
	.string "don't have two POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_MiuPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_MiuPostBattle::
	.string "MIU: TRAINER, your POKéMON are\n"
	.string "strong because you are friends.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_CameronIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_CameronIntro::
	.string "Being a psychic is about willpower.\p"
	.string "I've willed myself not to lose to\n"
	.string "anyone. That makes me strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_CameronDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_CameronDefeat::
	.string "I feel sad…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_CameronPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_CameronPostBattle::
	.string "Being a psychic is about willpower.\n"
	.string "I thought I wouldn't lose to you…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JackiIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JackiIntro::
	.string "Don't be too happy if your POKéMON\n"
	.string "develop psychic powers.\p"
	.string "You need to refine those powers to\n"
	.string "make them really useful.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JackiDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JackiDefeat::
	.string "Overwhelmed!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JackiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JackiPostBattle::
	.string "We all have psychic powers.\n"
	.string "We've just forgotten how to use them.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KindraIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KindraIntro::
	.string "MT. PYRE…\n"
	.string "Where the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\l"
	.string "Will your POKéMON sleep?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KindraDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KindraDefeat::
	.string "Overflowing with vitality…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KindraPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KindraPostBattle::
	.string "MT. PYRE…\n"
	.string "Where the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\p"
	.string "It must overflow with a power that\n"
	.string "soothes spirits…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JonasIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JonasIntro::
	.string "I lay in ambush, and a TRAINER has\n"
	.string "landed in my trap!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JonasDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JonasDefeat::
	.string "If you don't lose, how am I supposed\n"
	.string "to have fun playing ninja?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JonasPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JonasPostBattle::
	.string "I'm going to ambush a weaker-looking\n"
	.string "TRAINER next time.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KayleyIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KayleyIntro::
	.string "I just bought this parasol.\n"
	.string "My cuteness should be up by a third!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KayleyDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KayleyDefeat::
	.string "You're better than me by about\n"
	.string "five times!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_KayleyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_KayleyPostBattle::
	.string "Using accessories effectively is\n"
	.string "the secret behind fashion appeal.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_EdIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_EdIntro::
	.string "When there are no TRAINERS around,\n"
	.string "I let my POKéMON battle each other.\l"
	.string "I watch them.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_EdDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_EdDefeat::
	.string "I kind of like your POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_EdPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_EdPostBattle::
	.string "Hehe, I'm swiping your battling ideas!\n"
	.string "I think they'll make me better.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FernandoIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FernandoIntro::
	.string "I'll turn your lights out while\n"
	.string "I rip through this tune!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FernandoDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FernandoDefeat::
	.string "Hey, hold it!\n"
	.string "I was still playing the intro!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FernandoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FernandoPostBattle::
	.string "You're rock steady.\n"
	.string "I'd like to write a tune about you.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_AlbertoIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_AlbertoIntro::
	.string "I have to tell you, BIRD POKéMON\n"
	.string "are my obsession!\p"
	.string "Birds are cool!\n"
	.string "They're the best!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_AlbertoDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_AlbertoDefeat::
	.string "Even in defeat, BIRD POKéMON are cool!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_AlbertoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_AlbertoPostBattle::
	.string "I gather BIRD POKéMON feathers that\n"
	.string "scatter during battles.\p"
	.string "I'm going to make a hat with\n"
	.string "BIRD POKéMON feathers.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FrederickIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FrederickIntro::
	.string "Hello, child!\n"
	.string "Can you spare some time?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FrederickDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FrederickDefeat::
	.string "Ah, a mighty capable child!\n"
	.string "Let me contribute to your allowance.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_FrederickPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_FrederickPostBattle::
	.string "Contribute to your allowance?\n"
	.string "Wasn't the prize money enough?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JazmynIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JazmynIntro::
	.string "My confidence will get a boost by\n"
	.string "beating someone obviously strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JazmynDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JazmynDefeat::
	.string "There goes my confidence…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_JazmynPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_JazmynPostBattle::
	.string "They say that you can't judge a person\n"
	.string "by their appearance.\p"
	.string "But often, their looks don't lie…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_DavisIntro
Hoenn_Route123_Text_DavisIntro::
	.string "This is my awesome BUG POKéMON!\n"
	.string "My big brother got it for me.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_DavisDefeat
Hoenn_Route123_Text_DavisDefeat::
	.string "Waaaah!\n"
	.string "You meanie!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route123_Text_DavisPostBattle
Hoenn_Route123_Text_DavisPostBattle::
